        "section": "data-science",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Computer Vision",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Downsampling (stride-2):                   CNN stride=2 in convolution or pooling\n  Decimate signal by factor 2               Stride-2 conv = filter + downsample\n  Aliasing if not low-pass filtered first   BN/ReLU before stride reduces aliasing\n  (Nyquist: must sample at 2× bandwidth)"
    }
